\newlabel{tab:family-c}{{6}{19}{Family~C (pre-registered, 18 Holm-corrected tests): evidence-rescue soft weight (\#4) vs.\ simple reweighting baselines, Tail-F1. Verdict: \textbf {null}; on UNSW the soft weight is significantly \emph {worse} than freq-floor at rates 0.4/0.6 (CI upper bounds $-0.011$/$-0.013$). The superiority claim is withdrawn}{table.6}{}}
